    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds great for the main hall. I also want to add a smaller section nearby that talks about the 'conflicts' or 'struggles' that happened during expansion, but I don't want it to take away from the overall theme of the exhibit being about the growth and success of the country. How can I phrase the section about the indigenous tribes so it acknowledges them without making the whole exhibit feel like a tragedy or a story of failure?",
